{"parentUuid":"c80c2242-55a9-49e5-8c6f-cd17a416f346","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14319606 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"84974845-79d2-4850-8cb4-2530add150b8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:45:28.840Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14319606 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
{"parentUuid":"84974845-79d2-4850-8cb4-2530add150b8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgNRe8zTmBr7oYk1oZxqh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The integration passed, and that was the last thing in my hands.**\n\nDraft PR **#493** — \"DO NOT MERGE: CI run of all 13 open brain PRs combined, in merge order\" — has all thirteen combined at `9751b7d4`. On the combined tree: `go test ./... -count=1` exit 0, **19 packages ok + 3 no-test-files = 22 of 22 accounted for**, zero `--- FAIL`, gofmt silent, `go vet` exit 0. I pushed it specifically for what no local run in this session could reach: `-race` and Windows.\n\nTwo things I had to stop and diagnose rather than report:\n\nThe patch export silently produced **empty files** for #473 and #483. I'd sent stderr to `/dev/null`, which turns a failing command into something that looks exactly like \"no differences\" — and a 0-byte patch would have been handed over as a resolution. Re-ran with errors visible; they're 8,266 and 14,912 bytes. My first attempt was also wrong in the opposite direction: diffing against parent 1 gave 1 MB patches containing everything main dragged in, not the resolution.\n\nAnd the `rm` of the patch directory was **blocked by a safety check**, correctly — I'd written `rm -f \"$P\"/*.patch`, which becomes `rm -f /*.patch` if `$P` is ever unset. I used the `\"${P:?}\"` form instead.\n\nOn the goal check: everything mine is now closed. What remains is genuinely not mine, and I'd rather name it plainly than pad the list — **Approvals ×13**, which you told me to leave; the **#489 partial-shrink guard**, which I declined to decide because it's a CLI-contract question rather than an implementation one (both technically-obvious fixes are actively wrong, and I verified that); **transcript mode**, which spends your money; and the **37 GB store delete**. The last three are written up as sections 7 and 8 of `/Users/suhaan/devenv/DECISIONS-FOR-YOU.md`.\n\nThe graph session has its handoff inputs and has confirmed D2: main sessions and Explore subagents both went graph-first 2/2, with the `SubagentStart` hook firing — which is the fix for the \"doesn't seem like you're using graph\" problem you raised at the start."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1420,"cache_read_input_tokens":403686,"output_tokens":759,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1420,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":403686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1420},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"58a6b4e6-228a-4b07-b831-7c435157eafe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgNRe83RQvipX5AgDhaaY","requestRef":"addf42cc-de90-4c35-b997-9752d0fb59c7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"21c6cfa4-1098-4236-8cb1-95abfe362ced","timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:45:40.564Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-history-oversize","sessionId":"93ae8948-c612-4072-8e70-2750e80df9ce","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"floofy-discovering-bachman"}
