keep the package compiling. Verify your patch applied as a unique match before trusting any result.\n4. Full gate: `GOFLAGS=-timeout=40m mise run test:prepush > /tmp/g478.log 2>&1; echo \"EXIT=$?\" >> /tmp/g478.log`. The `-timeout` is REQUIRED: internal/cli is 232s idle but 805-855s under parallel load, against go test's 10m default, and other agents are running suites right now. Then grep the log for `--- FAIL` and the recorded EXIT. Never trust a bare exit code over an unread log.\n\nThen commit (conventional subject; body states what main extracted, what you kept, and the weakening you ran; NO AI/Claude attribution footer) and `git push origin perf/per-branch-fact-fingerprint`.\n\nEnv: this shell sets FORCE_COLOR=3, which fails colour-assert tests on correct code — reproduce on main before believing one. Never bare `git stash` (shared across worktrees).\n\nREPORT caveman-ultra compressed: conflicted hunks + how resolved; any renames followed in tests; the weakening and its exact `--- FAIL` line; gate EXIT + FAIL count + package count; commit SHA; anything unverified.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/80327498-7bd2-42a4-985a-9acba8ccaf85/tasks/a2f0d6d1e07f3111f.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"7d232a91-4a80-480b-b3a2-fab6f525c39d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-vanished","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-vanished","branch":"fix/export-skips-vanished-checkpoints","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":